  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "CATS College, China is a co-educational international secondary school + pathway college in Shanghai (Bao Shan District), part of CATS Global Schools.",
      "The school offers a UFP & A-Level blended programme (Grade 10-12), 2+1 A-Level (2 years in China + 1 year in UK), 2+1 US High School Diploma (2 in China + 1 in US), and standalone University Foundation Programme.",
      "Campus is shared with CSVPA China — both schools occupy the same Shanghai site at No. 3039 Pan Jing Road.",
      "73% of 2020 graduates progressed to top 100 US universities."
    ],
    "keyFacts": [
      "International secondary + pathway college",
